ct?)>>endobj18869 0 obj<</Parent 18682 0 R/Next 18868 0 R/Dest(SS.Q81.A6)/Prev 18870 0 R/Title(Article. 6 - Whether religion should be preferred to the other moral virtues?)>>endobj18870 0 obj<</Parent 18682 0 R/Next 18869 0 R/Dest(SS.Q81.A5)/Prev 18871 0 R/Title(Article. 5 - Whether religion is a theological virtue?)>>endobj18871 0 obj<</Parent 18682 0 R/Next 18870 0 R/Dest(SS.Q81.A4)/Prev 18872 0 R/Title(Article. 4 - Whether religion is a special virtue, distinct from the others?)>>endobj18872 0 obj<</Parent 18682 0 R/Next 18871 0 R/Dest(SS.Q81.A3)/Prev 18873 0 R/Title(Article. 3 - Whether religion is one virtue?)>>endobj18873 0 obj<</Parent 18682 0 R/Next 18872 0 R/Dest(SS.Q81.A2)/Prev 18683 0 R/Title(Article. 2 - Whether religion is a virtue?)>>endobj18874 0 obj<</Parent 18679 0 R/Next 18681 0 R/Dest(SS.Q82.A3)/Prev 18875 0 R/Title(Article. 3 - Whether contemplation or meditation is the cause of devotion?)>>endobj18875 0 obj<</Parent 18679 0 R/Next 18874 0 R/Dest(SS.Q82.A2)/Prev 18680 0 R/Title(Article. 2 - Whether devotion is an act of religion?)>>endobj18876 0 obj<</Parent 18676 0 R/Next 18678 0 R/Dest(SS.Q83.A16)/Prev 18877 0 R/Title(Article. 16 - Whether sinners impetrate anything from God by their prayers?)>>endobj18877 0 obj<</Parent 18676 0 R/Next 18876 0 R/Dest(SS.Q83.A15)/Prev 18878 0 R/Title(Article. 15 - Whether prayer is meritorious?)>>endobj18878 0 obj<</Parent 18676 0 R/Next 18877 0 R/Dest(SS.Q83.A14)/Prev 18879 0 R/Title(Article. 14 - Whether prayer should last a long time?)>>endobj18879 0 obj<</Parent 18676 0 R/Next 18878 0 R/Dest(SS.Q83.A13)/Prev 18880 0 R/Title(Article. 13 - Whether attention is a necessary condition of prayer?)>>endobj18880 0 obj<</Parent 18676 0 R/Next 18879 0 R/Dest(SS.Q83.A12)/Prev 18881 0 R/Title(Article. 12 - Whether prayer should be vocal?)>>endobj18881 0 obj<</Parent 18676 0 R/Next 18880 0 R/Dest(SS.Q83.A11)/Prev 18882 0 R/Title(Article. 11 - Whether the saints in heaven pray for us?)>>endobj