ul?)>>endobj19557 0 obj<</Parent 19419 0 R/Next 19421 0 R/Dest(SS.Q24.A11)/Prev 19558 0 R/Title(Article. 11 - Whether we can lose charity when once we have it?)>>endobj19558 0 obj<</Parent 19419 0 R/Next 19557 0 R/Dest(SS.Q24.A10)/Prev 19559 0 R/Title(Article. 10 - Whether charity can decrease?)>>endobj19559 0 obj<</Parent 19419 0 R/Next 19558 0 R/Dest(SS.Q24.A9)/Prev 19560 0 R/Title(Article. 9 - Whether charity is rightly distinguished into three degrees, beginning, progress, and perfection?)>>endobj19560 0 obj<</Parent 19419 0 R/Next 19559 0 R/Dest(SS.Q24.A8)/Prev 19561 0 R/Title(Article. 8 - Whether charity can be perfect in this life?)>>endobj19561 0 obj<</Parent 19419 0 R/Next 19560 0 R/Dest(SS.Q24.A7)/Prev 19562 0 R/Title(Article. 7 - Whether charity increases indefinitely?)>>endobj19562 0 obj<</Parent 19419 0 R/Next 19561 0 R/Dest(SS.Q24.A6)/Prev 19563 0 R/Title(Article. 6 - Whether charity increases through every act of charity?)>>endobj19563 0 obj<</Parent 19419 0 R/Next 19562 0 R/Dest(SS.Q24.A5)/Prev 19564 0 R/Title(Article. 5 - Whether charity increases by addition?)>>endobj19564 0 obj<</Parent 19419 0 R/Next 19563 0 R/Dest(SS.Q24.A4)/Prev 19565 0 R/Title(Article. 4 - Whether charity can increase?)>>endobj19565 0 obj<</Parent 19419 0 R/Next 19564 0 R/Dest(SS.Q24.A3)/Prev 19566 0 R/Title(Article. 3 - Whether charity is infused according to the capacity of our natural gifts?)>>endobj19566 0 obj<</Parent 19419 0 R/Next 19565 0 R/Dest(SS.Q24.A2)/Prev 19420 0 R/Title(Article. 2 - Whether charity is caused in us by infusion?)>>endobj19567 0 obj<</Parent 19416 0 R/Next 19418 0 R/Dest(SS.Q25.A11)/Prev 19568 0 R/Title(Article. 11 - Whether we are bound to love the demons out of charity?)>>endobj19568 0 obj<</Parent 19416 0 R/Next 19567 0 R/Dest(SS.Q25.A10)/Prev 19569 0 R/Title(Article. 10 - Whether we ought to love the angels out of charity?)>>endobj19569 0 obj<</Parent 19416 0 R/Next 19568 0 R/Dest(SS.Q25.A9)/Prev 19570 0 R/Title(Article