 original sin alone, suffer from a bodily fire, and are punished by fire?)>>endobj20854 0 obj<</Parent 20845 0 R/Dest(AP1.Q1.A2)/Prev 20853 0 R/Title(Article. 2 - Whether these same souls suffer spiritual affliction on account of the state in which they are?)>>endobj1 0 obj<</CropBox[0 0 612 792]/Parent 16593 0 R/Contents 3 0 R/Rotate 0/MediaBox[0 0 612 792]/Resources 2 0 R/Type/Page>>endobj2 0 obj<</Font<</F1 17068 0 R/F2 17071 0 R/F3 12552 0 R>>/ProcSet[/PDF/Text]>>endobj3 0 obj<</Length 3285/Filter/FlateDecode>>stream
